鸟或许也是因寂寞才啼鸣的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在两根栖木之间，忽而飞往那边，忽而飞回这边，来来回回，片刻不停。丝毫看不出有什么不满的样子。","derivedFrom":{"value":"那一天，整日聽著寂寥的筆聲度過。其間，時不時也能聽到啾啾的鳴叫聲。他想，文鳥或許也是因寂寞才啼鳴的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在兩根棲木之間，忽而飛往那邊，忽而飛回這邊，來來回回，片刻不停。絲毫看不出有什麼不滿的樣子。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"2609429":{"renderings":[{"id":"ce8eb127bd3ebfdc","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"2615122"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"玛丽在游乐园发现了一个男孩在独自哭泣，便轻声地问道：“喂，你，怎么了呀？迷路了吗？姐姐带你到迷路儿童中心好不好？”","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"2946902":{"renderings":[{"id":"d678a6779690f580","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"5072425"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"汤姆声音低沉。","direction":"fromJapanese"},{"id":"73fdc3a0bbd3607c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13144774"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"汤姆的声音很低沉。","derivedFrom":{"value":"湯姆的聲音很低沉。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"4138895":{"renderings":[{"id":"d0658a018b596e35","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"4147197"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"不好意思，可以稍微小声点说话吗？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"8586330":{"renderings":[{"id":"27ebb40bb3bbb973","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"10275160"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"请再小声一点说话。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"12418824":{"renderings":[{"id":"8f139d57aabf0685","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"12420104"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"可以请你小声一点吗？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}